 "highlights": [
  {
   "text": "An LLM pre-screens a 1,959-feature credit universe from definitions, no data rows",
   "chars": 81
  },
  {
   "text": "The semantic stage's cost depends on the variable book, not the number of decisions",
   "chars": 83
  },
  {
   "text": "LLM-assisted leaders win 5 of 6 held-out cases under three leader-choice rules",
   "chars": 78
  },
  {
   "text": "LLM-assisted subsets lose less AUC from development to holdout than classical ones",
   "chars": 82
  },
  {
   "text": "Home Credit logistic regression still favours mutual-information mRMR",
   "chars": 69
  }
